<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_BATTLECRUISER_class">Battlecruiser</text>
<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_BATTLECRUISER_name">Battlecruiser</text>
<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_BATTLECRUISER_desc">The Battlecruiser is a type of Terran capital ship employed in the Koprulu sector.</text>
<!--<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_BATTLECRUISER_desc">The Terran Battlecruiser stands as the pinnacle of Dominion naval engineering, an orbital fortress bristling with weapons and armored to The Terran Battlecruiser is the pinnacle of Dominion naval power, an orbital fortress built for long campaigns, combining overwhelming firepower with near-impenetrable defenses.</text>-->

<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_WRAITH_class">Scout</text>
<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_WRAITH_name">Wraith</text>
<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_WRAITH_desc">The Wraith is a Terran space superiority fighter used extensively in the Koprulu sector.</text>
<!--<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_WRAITH_desc">The Wraith is a Terran space superiority fighter known for it's maneuverability and cloaking technology.</text>-->

<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_VESSEL_class">Science</text>
<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_VESSEL_name">Vessel</text>
<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_VESSEL_desc">The Science Vessel is a type of Terran starship used for general exploration and scientific research purposes.</text>

<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_VALKYRIE_class">Assault</text>
<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_VALKYRIE_name">Valkyrie</text>
<text name="text_PLAYER_SHIP_TERRAN_VALKYRIE_desc">The Valkyrie missile frigate is a United Earth Directorate designed anti-fighter spacecraft.</text>

<!-- ENEMY SHIP CLASSES -->
<text name="text_TERRAN_SCOUT_class">Scout</text>
<text name="text_TERRAN_SQUADRON_class">Squadron</text>
<text name="text_TERRAN_BATTLECRUISER_class">Battlecruiser</text>	
<text name="text_TERRAN_SCIENCE_class">Science</text>
<text name="text_TERRAN_TRANSPORT_class">Transport</text>
<text name="text_TERRAN_ASSAULT_class">Assault</text>
<text name="text_TERRAN_BUILDING_class">Building</text>

<!-- TERRAN BURST LASER -->
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_desc">Originally designed for strafing ground targets, this 25mm laser cannon trades accuracy and targeting precision for increasing rates and volume of fire with successive volleys.</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_1_title">Burst Laser Mk I</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_1_short">Burst Laser I</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_2_title">Burst Laser Mk II</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_2_short">Burst Laser II</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_3_title">Burst Laser Mk III</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_3_short">Burst Laser III</text>

<!-- TERRAN HEAVY BURST LASER -->
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_HEAVY_desc">A heavy 40mm laser cannon designed to inflict extensive damage to enemy hulls, systems, and crew. Successive volleys increase its rate of fire, volume of fire, and stun chance at the expense of accuracy and targeting precision.</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_HEAVY_1_title">Heavy Burst Laser Mk I</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_HEAVY_1_short">Heavy Burst I</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_HEAVY_2_title">Heavy Burst Laser Mk II</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BURST_LASER_HEAVY_2_short">Heavy Burst II</text>

<!-- TERRAN LASER BATTERIES -->
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_desc">A coordinated laser barrage designed to concentrate firepower on a single target. Additional charges increase the number of shots, accuracy, targeting precision, and breach chance, but take progressively longer to accumulate.</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_1_title">Laser Battery Mk I</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_1_short">Laser Bat.I</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_2_title">Laser Battery Mk II</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_2_short">Laser Bat.II</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_3_title">Laser Battery Mk III</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_3_short">Laser Bat.III</text>

<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_HEAVY_desc">A heavy laser battery designed to deliver powerful, concentrated strikes against enemy vessels. Extended charging increases accuracy, targeting precision, and breach chance.</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_HEAVY_1_title">Heavy Laser Battery Mk I</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_HEAVY_1_short">H.Laser Bat.I</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_HEAVY_2_title">Heavy Laser Battery Mk II</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_LASER_BATTERY_HEAVY_2_short">H.Laser Bat.II</text>

<!-- GEMINI PAIRED -->
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_PAIRED_desc">A secondary missile launcher operating in tandem with an adjacent weapon. Duplicates the primary weapon's projectiles without consuming additional power or ammunition.</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_PAIRED_title">Gemini Missiles - Paired</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_PAIRED_short">Gemini Paired</text>

<!-- GEMINI BREACH -->
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_BREACH_desc">A specialized missile system equipped with armor-penetrating warheads. Capable of breaching enemy hulls and pairing with compatible missile systems.</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_BREACH_1_title">Gemini Missiles Mk I - Breach</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_BREACH_1_short">Gemini Breach I</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_BREACH_2_title">Gemini Missiles Mk II - Breach</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_BREACH_2_short">Gemini Breach II</text>

<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_BREACH_3_desc">A heavy missile system equipped with devastating armor-penetrating warheads. Breaches every tile in the targeted room, deals additional damage to systemless rooms, and can pair with compatible missile systems.</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_BREACH_3_title">Gemini Missiles Mk III - Breach</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_BREACH_3_short">Gemini Breach III</text>

<!-- GEMINI HELLFIRE -->
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_FIRE_desc">A specialized missile system equipped with incendiary warheads. Capable of igniting enemy compartments and pairing with compatible missile systems.</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_FIRE_1_title">Gemini Missiles Mk I - Hellfire</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_FIRE_1_short">Gemini Fire I</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_FIRE_2_title">Gemini Missiles Mk II - Hellfire</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_FIRE_2_short">Gemini Fire II</text>

<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_FIRE_3_desc">A heavy missile system equipped with high-yield incendiary warheads. Ignites every tile in the targeted room, deals additional system damage, and can pair with compatible missile systems.</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_FIRE_3_title">Gemini Missiles Mk III - Hellfire</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_FIRE_3_short">Gemini Fire III</text>

<!-- GEMINI ANTI-HULL -->
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_HULL_desc">A specialized missile system designed to compromise the structural integrity of enemy vessels. Deals double hull damage to systemless rooms and can pair with compatible missile systems.</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_HULL_1_title">Gemini Missiles Mk I - Anti-Hull</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_HULL_1_short">Gemini Anti-Hull I</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_HULL_2_title">Gemini Missiles Mk II - Anti-Hull</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_HULL_2_short">Gemini Anti-Hull II</text>

<!-- GEMINI ANTI-SYSTEM -->
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_SYS_desc">A specialized missile system designed to disable critical ship infrastructure. Deals additional system damage and can pair with compatible missile systems.</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_SYS_1_title">Gemini Missiles Mk I - Anti-System</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_SYS_1_short">Gemini Anti-Sys I</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_SYS_2_title">Gemini Missiles Mk II - Anti-System</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_SYS_2_short">Gemini Anti-Sys II</text>

<!-- GEMINI ION -->
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_ION_desc">A specialized missile system equipped with electromagnetic warheads designed to disrupt enemy defenses. Inflicts ion damage, disrupts shields, and can pair with compatible missile systems.</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_ION_1_title">Gemini Missiles Mk I - Ion</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_ION_1_short">Gemini Ion I</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_ION_2_title">Gemini Missiles Mk II - Ion</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_ION_2_short">Gemini Ion II</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_ION_3_title">Gemini Missiles Mk III - Ion</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_ION_3_short">Gemini Ion III</text>

<!-- YAMATO CANNON -->
<text name="weapon_ARTILLERY_YAMATO_LASER_title">Yamato Cannon</text>
<text name="weapon_ARTILLERY_YAMATO_LASER_short">Yamato Cannon</text>
<text name="weapon_ARTILLERY_YAMATO_LASER_desc">A powerful weapon that focuses a nuclear explosion into a concentrated energy barrage using magnetic fields. Artillery upgrades increase the volume of the blast. Operating below full power increases the weapon's charge time.</text>
<text name="weapon_ARTILLERY_YAMATO_LASER_tooltip">Artillery upgrades increase the volume of the blast. Operating below full power increases the weapon's charge time.</text>

<!-- EMP MISSILES -->
<text name="weapon_EMP_MISSILE_title">EMP Missile</text>
<text name="weapon_EMP_MISSILE_short">EMP</text>
<text name="weapon_EMP_MISSILE_desc">A specialized missile equipped with an electromagnetic pulse warhead designed to disable enemy electronics. Ionizes systems and disables crew drones in the targeted room and adjacent compartments.</text>

<!-- TERRAN IRRADIATE -->
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BEAM_IRRADIATE_desc">A high-energy stream of radioactive particles developed from nuclear waste disposal technology. Extended charging increases damage and radiation intensity, causing affected crew to suffer prolonged damage and spread erosion to rooms they occupy.</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BEAM_IRRADIATE_title">Irradiate</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BEAM_IRRADIATE_short">Irradiate</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BEAM_IRRADIATE_LITE_title">Irradiate Lite</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_BEAM_IRRADIATE_LITE_short">Irradiate L.</text>

<text name="weapon_TERRAN_MISSILE_HALO_title">Halo Missile</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_MISSILE_HALO_short">Halo</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_MISSILE_HALO_desc">Fires salvos of High Altitude Long Operating cluster rockets designed to overwhelm enemy defenses. Extended charging reduces ammunition consumption at the expense of targeting precision.</text>

<text name="weapon_TERRAN_MISSILE_LONGBOLT_title">Longbolt Missile</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_MISSILE_LONGBOLT_short">Longbolt</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_MISSILE_LONGBOLT_desc">[[TERRAN_MISSILE_LONGBOLT Needs Description]]</text>

<!-- TERRAN DEFENSE MATRIX -->
 <text name="drone_TERRAN_DEFENSE_DESC">The Defense Matrix generates a temporary deflection field utilizing Terran energy shield technology. Automatically generates protective shield layers in response to incoming attacks, dissipating once the threat has passed.</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_DEFENSE_1_title">Defense Matrix I</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_DEFENSE_2_title">Defense Matrix II</text>
<text name="weapon_TERRAN_DEFENSE_3_title">Defense Matrix III</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_DEFENSE_1_NAME">Defense Matrix Mk I</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_DEFENSE_1_SHORT">Matrix.I</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_DEFENSE_2_NAME">Defense Matrix Mk II</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_DEFENSE_2_SHORT">Matrix.II</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_DEFENSE_3_NAME">Defense Matrix Mk III</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_DEFENSE_3_SHORT">Matrix.III</text>

<!-- TERRAN SCV -->
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SCV_NAME">Terran SCV</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SCV_SHORT">SCV</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SCV_DESC">The T-280 Space Construction Vehicle (SCV) is a general-purpose engineering vehicle designed for construction and maintenance. Rapidly repairs damaged systems and hull breaches.</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SCV_1_DESC">The T-280 Space Construction Vehicle (SCV) is a general-purpose engineering vehicle designed for construction and maintenance. Rapidly repairs damaged systems and hull breaches, and can be sacrificed to perform external hull repairs.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_SCV_HULL_NAME">SCV Hull</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SCV_HULL_SHORT">SCV Hull</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SCV_HULL_DESC">Automatically repairs 3-5 damage to your hull. SCV is consumed once it finishes.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_GOLIATH_NAME">Goliath</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_GOLIATH_SHORT">Goliath</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_GOLIATH_DESC">The Goliath is a heavily armored Terran all-terrain combat walker designed to provide infantry and anti-air support. Engages hostile boarding parties while its mounted turret intercepts incoming projectiles and enemy drones.</text>

<!-- TERRAN SPIDER MINE -->
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_1_NAME">Spider Mine Qt.1</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_1_SHORT">Spider Mine I</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_1_DESC">Deploys a Terran Spider Mine. Mines burrow when set and are not player-controllable unless redeployed.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_2_NAME">Spider Mine Qt.2</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_2_SHORT">Spider Mine II</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_2_DESC">Deploys a pair of Terran Spider Mines. Mines burrow when set and are not player-controllable unless redeployed.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_3_NAME">Spider Mine Qt.3</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_3_SHORT">Spider Mine III</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_3_DESC">Deploys a set of three Terran Spider Mines. Mines burrow when set and are not player-controllable unless redeployed.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_NAME">Spider Mine</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_SHORT">Spider Mine</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_DESC">Mines burrow when set and are not player-controllable unless redeployed. Mines will automatically seek out targets and detonate when an enemy is nearby.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_MINE_NAME">Spider Mine</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_MINE_SHORT">Spider Mine</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_MINE_DESC">Mines will automatically seek out targets and detonate when an enemy is nearby. Redeploying a mine will make it controllable again.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_COMSAT_NAME">Comsat</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_COMSAT_SHORT">Comsat</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_COMSAT_DESC">Communications and sensor sweep capable of providing advanced targeting data. Temporarily enhances Sensors and improves weapon accuracy and targeting precision based on effective Sensors power.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_POD_NAME">Boarding Pod</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_POD_SHORT">Boarding Pod</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_POD_DESC">A transport capsule designed to deliver boarding parties directly to enemy vessels. Launches crew stationed in Drone Control toward enemy compartments.</text>

<!-- TERRAN CREW -->
<text name="crew_TERRAN_MARINE_NAME">Marine</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_MARINE_SHORT">Marine</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_MARINE_DESC">Basic soldier equipped with powered armor and a rapid-fire C-14 rifle.  

-Powered Armor:
    Minor fire and damage resistance
    Resistant to suffocation
    Reduced movement speed</text>

<text name="crew_TERRAN_MEDIC_NAME">Medic</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_MEDIC_SHORT">Medic</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_MEDIC_DESC">Field medic trained to supress enemy forces and keep infantry alive in combat zones.

-Powered Armor:
    Minor fire and damage resistance
    Resistant to suffocation
    Reduced movement speed</text>

<text name="crew_TERRAN_FIREBAT_NAME">Firebat</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_FIREBAT_SHORT">Firebat</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_FIREBAT_DESC">Flame-wielding shock trooper built for close combat and clearing out enemy infantry.

-Powered Armor:
    Immune to fire damage
    Minor damage resistance
    Resistant to suffocation
    Reduced movement speed</text>

<text name="crew_TERRAN_GHOST_NAME">Ghost</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_GHOST_SHORT">Ghost</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_GHOST_DESC">Cloaked specialist skilled in sabotage, psionics, and high-value target elimination.

-Hostile Environment Suit:
    Resistant to suffocation
    Increased movement speed</text>

<text name="crew_TERRAN_CIVILIAN_NAME">Civilian</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_CIVILIAN_SHORT">Civilian</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_CIVILIAN_DESC">Civilian personnel who excel at maintenance and emergency response, but are not equipped for combat.

-Expertise:
    Increased learning speed
    Increased repair speed
    Increased fire supression speed
    Increased damage taken</text>

<text name="crew_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_NAME">Spider Mine</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_SHORT">Spider Mine</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_DESC">The 52-QDMM spider mine is a type of terran self-propelled, area-denial ordnance.[crew_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_DESC]</text>

<text name="crew_TERRAN_SPIDER_MINE_NAME">Spider Mine</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_SPIDER_MINE_SHORT">Spider Mine</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_SPIDER_MINE_DESC">The 52-QDMM spider mine is a type of terran self-propelled, area-denial ordnance.[crew_TERRAN_SPIDER_MINE_DESC]</text>

<!-- TERRAN CREW STATIC ABILITIES -->
 <text name="crew_TERRAN_POWER_HEAL">Ability: Heal
     Heal nearby friendly troops.
</text>

 <text name="crew_TERRAN_POWER_CIVILIAN">Ability: Civilian
     Only uses half a crew slot.
</text>

<!-- TERRAN CREW ACTIVATED ABILITIES -->
<text name="ability_TERRAN_STIMPACK_BUTTON">STIMPACK</text>
<text name="ability_TERRAN_STIMPACK_TOOLTIP">[DURATION:10s -15HP]
	Increased damage and movement speed.</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_POWER_STIMPACK">Ability: [Stimpack]
     Double rate of fire and increase movement speed.
</text>

<text name="ability_TERRAN_OPTICAL_FLARE_BUTTON">OPTICAL FLARE</text>
<text name="ability_TERRAN_OPTICAL_FLARE_TOOLTIP">[COOLDOWN:30s]
	Fire an optical flare to stun enemies.</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_POWER_OPTICAL_FLARE">Ability: [Optical Flare]
    Stun nearby enemies.
</text>

<text name="ability_TERRAN_RESTORATION_BUTTON">RESTORATION</text>
<text name="ability_TERRAN_RESTORATION_TOOLTIP">[COOLDOWN:30s]
	Restore nearby friendly troops.</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_POWER_RESTORATION">Ability: [Restoration]
    Restore nearby friendly troops, clensing them of negative effects.
</text>

<text name="ability_TERRAN_CLOAK_BUTTON">CLOAK</text>
<text name="ability_TERRAN_CLOAK_TOOLTIP">[COOLDOWN:30s DURATION:15s]
	Cannot be targeted by enemies.</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_POWER_CLOAK">Ability: [Cloak]
    Become untargetable except by enemies with detectors.
</text>

<text name="ability_TERRAN_LOCKDOWN_BUTTON">LOCKDOWN</text>
<text name="ability_TERRAN_LOCKDOWN_TOOLTIP">[COOLDOWN:30s DURATION:15s]
	Fires a lockdown missile at designated target.</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_POWER_LOCKDOWN">Ability: [Lockdown]
    Fire a lockdown missile at an enemy system.
</text>


<text name="ability_TERRAN_SCV_REPAIR_HULL_BUTTON">REPAIR HULL</text>
<text name="ability_TERRAN_SCV_REPAIR_HULL_TOOLTIP">[READY]
	Repair a portion of the ships hull at the cost of an SCV.</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_POWER_REPAIR_HULL">Ability: [Repair Hull]
    Repair a portion of the ships hull at the cost of an SCV.
</text>

<text name="ability_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_MINE_BUTTON">SET-MINE</text>
<text name="ability_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_MINE_TOOLTIP">[READY]
	Click to arm Spider Mine</text>    
<text name="ability_TERRAN_SPIDER_REDEPLOY_BUTTON">REDEPLOY-MINE</text>
<text name="ability_TERRAN_SPIDER_REDEPLOY_TOOLTIP">[READY]
	Click to redeploy Spider Mines</text>

    <!-- UNUSED -->
<text name="ability_TERRAN_POD_LAUNCH_BUTTON">LAUNCH</text>
<text name="ability_TERRAN_POD_LAUNCH_TOOLTIP">Automatically activates when the custom crew drone is deployed.</text>

<!-- TERRAN AUGMENTS -->
<text name="system_lily_system_bracers_NAME">System Bracers</text>
<text name="system_lily_system_bracers_DESC">Passively protects your systems from damage, redirecting system damage towards itself instead (As long as it isn't destroyed itself).</text>

<text name="aug_TERRAN_WRAITH_BATTERY_NAME">Apollo Reactor</text>
<text name="aug_TERRAN_WRAITH_BATTERY_DESC">High yield uranium reactors designed by the Terran Confederacy.  

UPGRADE: Battery System (+1 max level)
UPGRADE: Cloaking System (+1 max level)

BONUS: Cloaking +1.65 seconds per active Cloaking power</text>

<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_LIGHT_NAME">Light Armor Plating</text>
<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_LIGHT_DESC">Light neosteel hulls and reinforced structural bracers provide better maneuverability at a cost of durability.  

ARMORED: System Bracers have a chance to block incoming damage (System Bracer Health * 40%)

BONUS: Evasion +2% per active Engine power
    
STRAFE: Increase Accuracy and Projectile Speed (Accuracy +0.5% per Evasion)</text>

<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_MEDIUM_NAME">Medium Armor Plating</text>
<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_MEDIUM_DESC">Layered neosteel hulls and reinforced structural plating make this ship more durable, at a slight cost to maneuverability.  
    
ARMORED: System Bracers have a chance to block incoming damage (System Bracer Health * 40%)

UPGRADE: System Bracers (+2 max level)

PENALTY: Evasion -1% per active Engine power
PENALTY: Cloaking -1 second per active Cloaking power</text>

<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_HEAVY_NAME">Heavy Armor Plating</text>
<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_HEAVY_DESC">Layered neosteel hulls and reinforced structural plating make this ship more durable, at a significant cost to maneuverability.

ARMORED: System Bracers have a chance to block incoming damage (System Bracer Health * 40%)

UPGRADE: System Bracers (+3 max level)

PENALTY: Evasion -2% per active Engine power
PENALTY: Cloaking -2 seconds per active Cloaking power</text>

<text name="aug_SC_DETECTOR_NAME">Detector</text>
<!-- Protoss could be called Advanced Sensor Array, Zerg could be something biological -->
<text name="aug_SC_DETECTOR_DESC">Advanced sensors allow this ship to track enemy targets more effectively, providing bonuses to weapon accuracy.
    
UPGRADE: Sensors (+2 max level)

